### 1. Shorten a URL
POST http://localhost:8080/api/shorten
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "url": "https://www.example.com/some/very/long/url/that/needs/to/be/shortened"
}

### 2. Retrieve original URL (replace KEY with the shortKey from the previous response)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/shorten/ZO1dYa
